content.content:
Catalyst hooks

HOOK                           EVENT          MATCHER      STATE
PreCompact-handoff-write.sh    PreCompact     ''           disabled
SessionStart-handoff-read.sh   SessionStart   ''           enabled

Registered by hooks.json — they run from the plugin, so there is nothing to install.
Toggle the advisory two with: /catalyst:hooks disable precompact|sessionstart
---config file---
{
  "hooks": {
    "precompact_prompt": false
  }
}

